---

The Python modules in this directory (`app/tg_proxy_engine/`) are sourced
verbatim from https://github.com/Flowseal/tg-ws-proxy and redistributed under
the MIT license above. The upstream project is owned by Flowseal.

Only the engine library modules (`proxy/*.py`, `utils/*.py` in the upstream
repo) are included here. The upstream tray-UI files (`windows.py`, `macos.py`,
`linux.py`, `ui/`, `utils/tray_common.py`, `utils/update_check.py`,
`utils/win32_theme.py`) are NOT included — ZapretGUI runs the engine as a
plain asyncio task inside its own process and provides its own GUI.
